{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-guangdong-dousheng-electronics-co-dot-ltd-5w-usb-c-power-adapter-sold-via-amazon-2604-0121","content_id":"620f2554-9506-47ed-9871-49585144cafd","description":"Product Safety Report for 5W USB-C Power Adapter presenting a high risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a3b582b5-d601-47de-8eee-b4a6e2a9bd16","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-07T18:21:20+01:00","id":"a3b582b5-d601-47de-8eee-b4a6e2a9bd16","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-07T18:21:20+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4d359092f65594cb02998b/2604-0121-product-safety-report-5W-charger-USB-C-power-adaptor.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Guangdong Dousheng Electronics Co., Ltd 5W USB-C Power Adapter sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of fire because the plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed, and the listing removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Chargers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Guangdong Dousheng Electronics Co., Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>SF-20325</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0DJX8BB6B</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon product identifiers</td>\n      <td>FBA15LFS8LBU000007, X0025HW97V.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A 5W charging cable with wall plug.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a3b582b5-d601-47de-8eee-b4a6e2a9bd16\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4d359092f65594cb02998b/2604-0121-product-safety-report-5W-charger-USB-C-power-adaptor.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The adapter presents a risk of fire because the plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363 and has with excessive live and neutral pin sleeve dimensions and an undersized insulated shutter-opening device (ISOD) pin. This means the plug cannot make a secure connection to the socket, which may lead to it overheating and igniting, causing a fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon). Owners are advised to stop using the product and contact the distributor they purchased from for redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0121</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-07T17:22:12Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-07","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-07T18:22:12+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-guangdong-dousheng-electronics-co-dot-ltd-5w-usb-c-power-adapter-sold-via-amazon-2604-0121","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-guangdong-dousheng-electronics-co-dot-ltd-5w-usb-c-power-adapter-sold-via-amazon-2604-0121","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-guangdong-dousheng-electronics-co-dot-ltd-5w-usb-c-power-adapter-sold-via-amazon-2604-0121","content_id":"620f2554-9506-47ed-9871-49585144cafd","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-07T17:22:12Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Guangdong Dousheng Electronics Co., Ltd 5W USB-C Power Adapter sold via Amazon (2604-0121)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-guangdong-dousheng-electronics-co-dot-ltd-5w-usb-c-power-adapter-sold-via-amazon-2604-0121","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_n